contentText:
While the British prime minister , PepsiCo and David Schwimmer , among others, are publicly denouncing the artist formerly known as Kanye West, Aubrey O&rsquo;Day has other plans.

In a series of posts and replies to other users on X, the former Danity Kane member is defending her decision to attend both of Ye&rsquo;s sold-out comeback shows at SoFi Stadium in Inglewood, California, last week. O&rsquo;Day was first called out for going to the shows after an X user reposted a video of the singer talking about seeing Ye for the second night in a row and asked why she didn&rsquo;t talk about going to the concerts on X.

